        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ሁሉ ፡ እግዚአብሔርን ፡ በወንጌል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሃይማኖት ፡ ይሹት ፡ ዘንድ ፡ (ይቤ ፡ እግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዚአብሔር ፡ ዘገብረ ፡ ዘንተ ፡ ዘኢይትዐ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወቅ ፡ ዘእምፍጥረተ ፡ ዓለም) ፡ ጺዋዌ ፡ ነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍሱን ፡ ሚጠተ፡ ነፍሱን፡ ያደረገ፡ ዓለም፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከተፈጠረ ፡ ጀምሮ ፡ ታይቶ ፡ የማያውቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔር ፡ እንዲህ ፡ አለ ፡ ብሎ ፡ መ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽሐፍ ፡ እንደ ፡ ተናገረ ፡ የኅብሩ ፡ ቃለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነቢያት ፡ በዝንቱ ፡ ላለው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": "፲፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፱ ፤ ⟪ወይእዜኒ ፡ እብለክሙ ፡ ኢታክብዱ ፡ ላዕለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሕዛብ ፡ እለ ፡ ተመይጡ ፡ ኀበ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሁንም ፡ አምነው ፡ ከአምልኮ ፡ ጣዖት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ አምልኮተ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ በተመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለሱ ፡ አሕዛብ ፡ ሥርዐት፡ አታጽኑባቸው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እላችኋለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፳",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳ ፤ ⟪ዳዕሙ ፡ አዝዝዎሙ ፡ ይርሐቁ ፡ እምዘ ፡ ይዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሑ ፡ ለአማልክት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለጣዖት ፡ መሥዋዕት ፡ ከመሠዋት ፡ ይከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለከሉ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ አዝዟቸው ፡ እንጅ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእማውታ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙቶ ፡ የተገኘውን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወደም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደም ፡ ከመብላት ፡ ይከለከሉ ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐተታ ፡ ደሙ ፡ ሲረጋ ፡ አንፍረው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቆልተው ፡ ይበሉታልና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምዝሙት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዝሙት ፡ ይከለከሉ ፡ ዘንድ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዘይጸልኡ ፡ ለርእሶሙ ፡ ኢይግበሩ ፡ ዲበ ፡ ቢጾሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለራሳቸው ፡ የሚጠሉትን ፡ በባልንጀሮ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቻቸው፡ እንዳያደርጉ፡ ይከለከሉ፡ ዘንድ፡ አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘዟቸው፡ እንጅ፡ ዘፍጥ፡ ፱፡፬።ዘሌዋ፡፫፡፲፯።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": "፳፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፩ ፤ ⟪ወሙሴሂ ፡ ቦ፡እምቀዲሙ ፡ ዘይሰብክ፡ሎሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በበአህጉር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙሴም ፡ ከጥንት ፡ ጀምሮ ፡ በየሀገሩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ በየአንቀጹ ፡ የሚያስተምራቸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ ይህን ፡ ነበር ፡ይህን፡ ያስተምራቸው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበር ፡ የሚያስተምራቸው ፡ ሙሴ ፡ ነበር።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያነብብዎ ፡ በመኳርብት ፡ በኵሉ ፡ ሰናብት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅዳም ፡ ቅዳም ፡ በምኵራብ ፡ ይመለከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱት ፡ ነበር ፡ ም ፡ ፲፫ ፡ ፲፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": "፳፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፪ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ ፡ ኀብሩ ፡ ሐዋርያት ፡ ወቀሲሳን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወኵሉ ፡ ሕዝብ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይኅረዩ ፡ እምውስቴቶሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕደወ ፡ ዘይፌንዉ ፡ አንጾኪያ ፡ ምስለ ፡ ጳውሎስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወበርናባስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ሐዋርያትና ፡ ቀሳውስት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕዝቡም ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ከጳውሎስና ፡ ከበርና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባስ ፡ ጋራ ፡ ወደ ፡ አንጾኪያ ፡ የሚሰዷቸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ከነሱ ፡ ወገን ፡ ይመርጡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘንድ ፡ አንድ ፡ ሆኑ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኀረዩ ፡ ይሁዳሃ ፡ ዘተሰምየ ፡ በርስያን ፡ ወሲላስሃ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕደወ ፡ ሊቃውንተ ፡ በውስተ ፡ ቢጾሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድ ፡ ሆነውም ፡ ከወገኖቻቸው፡ ይልቅ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተማሩ ፡በወገኖቻቸው ፡ ዘንድ ፡ የከበሩ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲላስንና ፡ በርስያን ፡ የተባለ ፡ ይሁዳን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መረጡ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": "፳፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፫ ፤ ⟪ወጸሐፉ ፡ በእደዊሆሙ ፡ መልእክተ ፡ እንተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትብል ፡ ከመዝ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጃቸውም፡እንዲህ፡ የምትል፡ ክታብ፡ጻፉ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እምልኡካን ፡ ወቀሲሳን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሐዋርያት ፡ ከቀሳውስት ፡ የተላከች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክታብ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ለአኀው ፡ ለእለ ፡ በአንጾኪያ ፡ ወሶርያ ፡ ወቂልቅያ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
